{"4254250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Notebook Battlegrounds", "steam_appid": 4254250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a few friends and get ready for a <strong><u>funny fun</u></strong> game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your microphone, say the funny phrases on you screen to shoot opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity based voice chat allows players to hear each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find extra words, which do special attacks when said with your phrase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in Battle Royale (Solo or Duos) or Deathmatch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PVP Battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/feeafb66dc1b392d4b7bd1aca871ecad.poster.avif?t=1773683021\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/feeafb66dc1b392d4b7bd1aca871ecad.webm?t=1773683021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/feeafb66dc1b392d4b7bd1aca871ecad.mp4?t=1773683021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Find Special Words for powerful attacks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/2e2e9a26fc2d6d31024c2b16d87ea18c.poster.avif?t=1773683021\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/2e2e9a26fc2d6d31024c2b16d87ea18c.webm?t=1773683021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/2e2e9a26fc2d6d31024c2b16d87ea18c.mp4?t=1773683021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Climb The Leaderboards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/681215678127985cc879b53934ccd532.avif?t=1773683021\" width=800 height=182 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a few friends and get ready for a <strong><u>funny fun</u></strong> game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your microphone, say the funny phrases on you screen to shoot opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity based voice chat allows players to hear each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find extra words, which do special attacks when said with your phrase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in Battle Royale (Solo or Duos) or Deathmatch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PVP Battle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/feeafb66dc1b392d4b7bd1aca871ecad.poster.avif?t=1773683021\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254250/extras/feeafb66dc1b392d4b7bd1aca871ecad.webm?t=1773683021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a